3T10:10:56Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T10:10:56Z","body":"Hi, I’d like to work on this issue to gain experience with large-scale TypeScript/API migrations.\n\n**Approach:**\n* Migrate the generated client from v1 to v2 and update the affected API call sites.\n* Adapt `path`, `query`, and `body` parameters to the new API structure.\n* Update response/error handling and mutation options where required.\n* Bump `ts-morph` to v28 and resolve the resulting TypeScript issues.\n* Run the existing lint, test, build, and Playwright checks to verify the migration.\n\nI’d appreciate it if you could assign this issue to me.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5278941731/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Arbaaz123676","id":208905841,"node_id":"U_kgDODHOmcQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208905841?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arbaaz123676","html_url":"https://github.com/Arbaaz123676","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arbaaz123676/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arbaaz123676/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arbaaz123676/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arbaaz123676/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arbaaz123676/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arbaaz123676/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arbaaz123676/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arbaaz123676/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arbaaz123676/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5294808926","